# image 1
Style: Chinese Ink Wash (Sumi-e)
Aspect Ratio: 16:9
An artistic illustration for the tea page "Tanyang Gongfu (Panyang Congou - 坦洋工夫)": misty terraced tea hills of Fu'an in northeastern Fujian with a quiet river valley below, minimal serene composition; in the close foreground a scatter of thin, tightly twisted black tea strands with a few golden tips; a small white porcelain cup holding bright amber-red liquor with a luminous golden ring at the rim; wet-on-wet ink wash textures with restrained warm amber accents and soft paper grain; no text, no letters, no characters, no logos; premium, calm, museum-poster feel, high quality digital art.
